<item><title>Cameroon minister Hamadou Moustapha dies at 81</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-minister-hamadou-moustapha-dies-at-81-6e38da/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-minister-hamadou-moustapha-dies-at-81-6e38da/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>The minister in charge of mission at the presidency died after a long illness at his home in Yaounde.</description><pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:06:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-minister-hamadou-moustapha-dies-at-81-6e38da/share.jpg" length="37974" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-minister-hamadou-moustapha-dies-at-81-6e38da/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
